    "head_commit_message": "perf(sim): spans, rank groups and the re-form's plan follow change (spec 39 step 10b-ii)\n\nA contact field keeps each squad's extent along an axis while it borrows the\nsquads, so a decision works a squad's span out once, not once a pair. A\nshooting squad's aim (the hostile ranks and their gaps) is worked out once for\nall its shooters. A re-form that planned and started nothing isn't planned\nagain while what it reads is the same to the bit. Outcomes are unchanged.\nfighters() stays as it is, with the reason in the spec.\n\nRefs #557\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011AyPi3APyQKRZd6y3U4Xb7",
